OL,3,GNEWSAUnionist parties need to 'set
OL,4,Aaside egos' says DUP leader
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnionist politicians need to "set aside
OL,7,Ftheir individual egos" to focus on
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland, the leader of the
OL,9,FDemocratic Unionist Party (DUP) has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe DUP has faced pressure from some
OL,13,Fwithin the party and unionist rivals
OL,14,Fover its response to the Drumcree
OL,15,Fparading dispute.
OL,17,FGavin Robinson said "division costs" as
OL,18,Fhe renewed his party's calls for
OL,19,Fcooperation between unionist parties at
OL,20,FStormont.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
